sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Python Backtest Worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant REG as StrategyRegistry
    participant RT as StrategyRuntime
    participant EX as BBO ExecutionSimulator
    participant OUT as Transactional Outbox

    W->>DB: atomic claim queued/expired job<br/>SKIP LOCKED → lease_token T, attempt n
    DB-->>W: JobEnvelope(experiment_id, exact versions/hashes)
    W->>DB: UPSERT run=running WHERE current lease permits
    W->>DB: load immutable Candle+BBO dataset ordered by event_time/seq
    W->>DB: load StrategySpec + ExecutionPolicy + optional SentimentSnapshot
    W->>REG: resolve exact strategy version/fingerprint

    par deterministic execution
        W->>RT: chronological replay with causal views
        RT->>EX: BUY/SELL/HOLD signals
        EX-->>W: LONG/SHORT TradeFacts + signals + equity<br/>fee/spread/slippage/SL/TP/fallback flags
    and heartbeat every lease/4
        W->>DB: extend lease WHERE job_id AND lease_token=T
        alt 0 rows
            W->>W: cancel computation and discard buffered result
        end
    end

    W->>DB: BEGIN
    W->>DB: batch INSERT immutable signals/trades/equity
    W->>DB: UPDATE run completed WHERE lease_token=T
    W->>DB: UPDATE job completed WHERE lease_token=T
    W->>OUT: INSERT BacktestCompleted pending<br/>result_hash + aggregate_seq
    W->>DB: COMMIT

    alt any guarded UPDATE affects 0 rows
        W->>DB: ROLLBACK
        Note over W,DB: Stale worker không được ghi đè worker mới.
    end

    Note over REG,EX: Worker và realtime service import cùng Python package/runtime.<br/>Không tồn tại backtest-only strategy implementation.
